{"seq":2,"slug":"building-companies","title":"缔造企业","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/core-contributions/building-companies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"apple-and-its-culture","title":"苹果及其企业文化","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/core-contributions/building-companies/apple-and-its-culture","wordCount":1457,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"pixar-and-computer-animation","title":"皮克斯与计算机动画","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/core-contributions/building-companies/pixar-and-computer-animation","wordCount":1536,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"# 缔造企业\n\n乔布斯的贡献不止于产品，还在于他缔造与重塑伟大企业的能力。本章考察他作为企业缔造者的成就：复兴苹果、塑造其独特文化，以及把皮克斯打造为动画电影的标杆。\n\n第一篇文档讲述他如何塑造苹果独特而强大的企业文化——聚焦、保密、追求卓越。第二篇文档讲述他与皮克斯的故事，以及他如何在那里学会管理创意人才、打造伟大的创意型组织。\n"}